    "original_requirement": "构建一个智能孵化箱控制系统，使用 DHT11（D7）、加热器继电器 D10、风扇 D5、蜂鸣器 D6、TM1637（CLK=D4，DIO=D5）、LED D13 和按钮 D2。系统需要维持温度在目标范围内并周期性通风；按钮可切换设定值查看模式和当前值显示模式。若温度连续 1 分钟高于上限或低于下限则报警并串口输出 incubation abnormal。",
    "effective_requirement": "构建一个智能孵化箱控制系统，使用 DHT11（D7）、加热器继电器 D10、风扇 D5、蜂鸣器 D6、TM1637（CLK=D4，DIO=D3）、LED D13 和按钮 D2。系统需要维持温度在目标范围内并周期性通风；按钮可切换设定值查看模式和当前值显示模式。若温度连续 1 分钟高于上限或低于下限则报警并串口输出 incubation abnormal。\nResolved hardware configuration (authoritative pin assignments; original conflicts were explicitly remapped). This is a PARTIAL inventory of recognized roles, not a whitelist: all other explicit source wiring remains required. device_role identifies wiring only, not the final catalog operation: preserve requested PWM, calibration, thresholds, timers and all other behavior.\n{\"version\": \"configuration-defaults-v3\", \"board\": \"arduino:avr:uno\", \"devices\": [{\"device_role\": \"digital_input\", \"pin\": \"D2\"}, {\"device_role\": \"digital_output\", \"pin\": \"D10\"}, {\"device_role\": \"digital_output\", \"pin\": \"D13\"}, {\"device_role\": \"digital_output\", \"pin\": \"D5\"}, {\"device_role\": \"tone_output\", \"pin\": \"D6\"}, {\"device_role\": \"dht\", \"pin\": \"D7\"}, {\"device_role\": \"tm1637_number\", \"clk_pin\": \"D4\", \"dio_pin\": \"D3\"}], \"serial\": {\"baud\": 9600, \"framing\": \"line_or_idle\", \"idle_timeout_ms\": 20}}\nSerial baud=9600; framing=line_or_idle; idle_timeout_ms=20.",
